# SB Gunmetal_mod.ask -- Ableton Live theme XML, converted by tools/themes/ask_to_theme.py
# SB_GUNMETAL_MOD: the pack's SB Gunmetal with three Live roles changed by hand
# (architect 2026-11-07..12); A SYSTEM THEME, moved there from the pack's
# EXTRA as the `default` theme's source (2026-11-12, session 114, "with
# fresh eyes, gunmetal is far and away more relaxing") and staying there
# since the default became Arc-Dark (2026-11-18, send Y; src/gui/
# theme_roles.h's THE LIST):
#   WaveformColor 090A0C -> 151619: THE STEM-OVER-INK RULE, the ink lit above
#     the selection stem (ControlContrastFrame 0B0D11) by SB Bronze's step,
#     CIELAB L* 3.61, the hue kept by scaling linear RGB (session 98).
#   ControlForeground BEB3A5 -> B3B4BD, TextDisabled 7E7469 -> 737581: Live's
#     Default Dark Cool Medium text pair in place of the pack's, which is
#     Live's Default Dark Warm Medium pair (2026-11-12, session 113;
#     confirmed session 114, "the cool medium text").
#   RangeDefault stays the pack's own DFE2CF, the playhead's head (2026-11-13,
#     session 121, his glass: "the reversal on the playhead looks good"; the
#     session-114 head B3B4BD, the icon glyph color, and its line D9DADE
#     superseded); its line the derived half toward white, EFF0E7.
# ScrollbarInnerTrack and ClipBorder added by hand from SB Gunmetal.ask (architect 2026-11-17, session 140)
# WindowBackground, TitleForeground and SidebarForeground, our own roles (not Live's), added by hand: WindowBackground this file's SurfaceArea, TitleForeground and SidebarForeground its ControlForeground, so nothing here changes look (architect 2026-11-19, send Z)
# TooltipBackground, CardBackground and CardStandingBackground, our own fills (not Live's), added by hand: TooltipBackground this file's SurfaceBackground, CardBackground and CardStandingBackground its Alert, opaque, so nothing here changes look (send AA's stage D1, 2026-11-19)
# ScaleTrough, our own role (not Live's), added by hand: this file's ScrollbarInnerTrack, so nothing here changes look (send AA's stage D2, 2026-11-19)
# ScaleSliderBorder, our own role (not Live's), added by hand: this file's ClipBorder, so nothing here changes look (send AA's stage D3, 2026-11-19)
# ButtonHoverBackground and ScrollbarSliderHover, our own roles (not Live's), added by hand: ButtonHoverBackground this file's SurfaceBackground, ScrollbarSliderHover its ScrollbarInnerHandle, so no hover shows here (send CC, 2026-11-20)
# PlayheadLine, HoverLine, CueHover, CueDisabledHover and CueDisabledLabelHover, our own roles (not Live's), added as tools/themes/ask_to_theme.py writes them: PlayheadLine white half way to this file's RangeDefault (the playhead's line as the derivation drew it), HoverLine its ScrollbarInnerHandle, CueHover its ViewCheckControlEnabledOn, CueDisabledHover its BackgroundClip, CueDisabledLabelHover its TextDisabled, so the playhead's line keeps its look and no marker hover shows here (architect 2026-11-21, send FF)
